-# data-turbo-temporary keeps the messages out of the snapshot Turbo shows on back navigation.
.max-w-7xl.mx-auto.px-4.pt-6.space-y-3{ class: "sm:px-6 lg:px-8", data: { turbo_temporary: true } }
  - messages.each do |type, message|
    = render IronAdmin::Ui::AlertComponent.new(message: message, type: type, role: "alert")
